    "html": "<p>The diagram shows two cylindrical wires, X and Y. Wire X has a length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"l\"></span>, a diameter <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>, and a resistivity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\rho\"></span>. Wire Y has a length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2l\"></span>, a diameter of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{2}\"></span>and a resistivity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\rho}{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{resistance of X}}{\\textit{resistance of Y}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">4</li><li data-label=\"B\">2</li><li data-label=\"C\">0.5</li><li data-label=\"D\">0.25</li></ol>"
